1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,317
Five things you must do in Eritrea.

2
00:00:02,517 --> 00:00:04,187
Do sit for a coffee ceremony.

3
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:07,696
The host roasts the beans in front of you,
then serves three cups.

4
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:10,929
Do ride the steam train from Massawa to
Asmara.

5
00:00:11,129 --> 00:00:13,755
It climbs more than 2 kilometers up from
the Red Sea.

6
00:00:13,955 --> 00:00:15,555
Do see the Fiat Tagliero.

7
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:20,004
This 1938 gas station looks like an
airplane, in a UNESCO city.

8
00:00:20,204 --> 00:00:22,619
Do watch the Sunday cycling in Asmara.

9
00:00:22,819 --> 00:00:25,980
Thousands line the streets, in a country
that loves the sport.

10
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,763
And do snorkel the Dahlak islands.

11
00:00:28,962 --> 00:00:33,544
More than 200 Red Sea islands, but you
need a permit, so plan ahead.

